e TokenizationSpoke with a signature.\"},\"mintWithSig((address,uint256,address,uint256,uint256),bytes)\":{\"notice\":\"Mints shares of the TokenizationSpoke with a signature.\"},\"withdrawWithSig((address,uint256,address,uint256,uint256),bytes)\":{\"notice\":\"Withdraws assets from the TokenizationSpoke with a signature.\"},\"redeemWithSig((address,uint256,address,uint256,uint256),bytes)\":{\"notice\":\"Redeems shares from the TokenizationSpoke with a signature.\"},\"depositWithPermit(uint256,address,uint256,uint8,bytes32,bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"Deposits assets into the vault with an underlying asset ERC2612-typed permit.\"},\"permit(address,address,uint256,uint256,uint8,bytes32,bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"Sets approval for `spender` to spend `owner`'s share tokens via EIP712-typed signature.\"},\"usePermitNonce()\":{\"notice\":\"Revokes the current PERMIT_NAMESPACE_NONCE of caller & increments the nonce at this key.\"},\"renounceAllowance(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Resets the allowance of an owner for the caller.\"},\"hub()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the address of the associated Hub.\"},\"assetId()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the identifier of the associated asset.\"},\"useNonce(uint192)\":{\"notice\":\"Allows caller to revoke their next sequential nonce at specified `key`.\"},\"nonces(address,uint192)\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the next unused nonce for an address and key. Result contains the key prefix.\"}},\"events\":{\"SetTokenizationSpokeImmutables(address,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted when the immutable variables of the TokenizationSpoke are set.\"}},\"errors\":{\"InvalidSignature()\":[{\"notice\":\"Thrown when given signature is invalid.\"}],\"InvalidAccountNonce(address,uint256)\":[{\"notice\":\"Thrown when nonce being consumed does not match `currentNonce` for `account`.\"}]},\"notice\":\"ERC4626 compliant wrapper to tokenize one listed asset of the connected Hub.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"lib/crane/contracts/protocols/lending/aave/v4